# aPToP §1.0.1 — Law of Portation again, simplified to ⊤
# Book "Material Implication, 3 times" expanded to one apply per step.

laws boolean

theorem Law of Portation to ⊤: (a ∧ b ⇒ c ≡ a ⇒ (b ⇒ c)) ≡ ⊤
    (a ∧ b ⇒ c ≡ a ⇒ (b ⇒ c))                    Material Implication
=   (¬(a ∧ b) ∨ c ≡ a ⇒ (b ⇒ c))                 Material Implication
=   (¬(a ∧ b) ∨ c ≡ ¬a ∨ (b ⇒ c))                Material Implication
=   (¬(a ∧ b) ∨ c ≡ ¬a ∨ (¬b ∨ c))               Duality
=   (¬a ∨ ¬b ∨ c ≡ ¬a ∨ ¬b ∨ c)                  Reflexivity of =
=   ⊤
